	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Se commendat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Aestate hac elapsa, ter maxime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <placeName>Wallesiam</placeName>, patriam <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>meam, adii.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Percepi autem quędam ibidem, unde maxime dolui et quod <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>acerbissime tuli.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dicam autem, si tu audire sustinueris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Biblia <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>aliquot, haud sane ita pauca <persName>Wallesianus</persName> quidam anno abhinc secundo <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>aut tertio forsitan <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> mercatus est ac deprehensus est <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>apud <placeName ref="l869">Transsylvanos</placeName> illum mercaturam hanc illis adversissimam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>advehere.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Unde mox episcopo <placeName>Sedunensi</placeName> ab iis (<placeName ref="l2469">Underwaldensibus</placeName>) <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>supplicibus ac minacibus etiam literis (in pago <placeName ref="l1641">Sachseln</placeName> scriptis) <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>accusatur et traditur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Qui bonus vir continuo rapitur ab episcopo, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>plectitur, ac libris iussu episcopi <placeName>Vulcano</placeName> sacrificatur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Unde omnes, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quotquot evangelio <persName>Wallisię</persName> nomen dedisse deprehensi sunt, maximo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>periculo involvi coeperunt.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Maximus omnium est furor <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l869">Transsylvanorum</placeName> ad evangelium Christi pessumdandum; insaniunt <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>plane hac in re.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Accrescunt in dies perfidiarum suarum in deum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ac verbum eius immanitates.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Plurimorum enim conscientias olim <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>pias labefactatas inde <placeName>Wallesię</placeName> persensi ac plane perspexi etiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Novisti autem tu adhuc, clarissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, quoties te ad <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>versiones multas Biblię uno obtutu opponendas ac imprimendas <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>interpellare haud subveritus sim, ac rationes multas recenser<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>e hic poteram, unde hęc ad c(laritudinem) t(uam) scribendi ac te obsecrandi <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>motus fuerim.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Linguarum notitiam adprime utilem ac necessariam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>omnibus sacras literas tractaturis, canones veteres, iudicia patrum, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>concilia plurima una testantur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Referre horum multa poteram, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nisi sublimitatem tuam non rogare, sed docere (unde turpitudinis <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>reatum effugere nequirem) videri possem.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Exempla tantum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>duo adtexam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName>Iohannes Brisgoicus</persName>, doctor theologię clarissimus, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>papista tamen, <placeName ref="l922">Friburgi Brisgoię</placeName> olim ordinarius, non sumebat <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ullam lectionem Novi Testamenti interpretandam, nisi versionem <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>novam cum veteri contulisset; <persName>Erasmica</persName> enim mirum in modum delectabatur <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>iuvabaturque.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Versionum igitur rationes diligentius perpendens <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>et contemplans ac asperius versa prudenter aequabat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Plurimum enim referre saepe in lectione nobis inculcabat penitius <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>hec inspexisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Ad hęc <persName ref="p5254">Iohannes Hoffmeisterus</persName>, papisticae <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>religionis propugnator strenuissimus, provincialis <placeName>Augustinensium</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Psalterium <placeName>Campensis</placeName> cum alia translatione, quam e regione habet <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>(duas enim Psalterium illud habet) semper in sinu aut manibus <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>gestabat.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">At aliam hanc translationem (quam dixi) <persName>Zwinglii</persName> esse <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>affirmabat, illi laudatissimam ac charissimam.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Haec autem ita <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>se habere scit optimus deus, qui iratus mihi sit, nisi hęc vers(?) a <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>sint.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Obnixius itaque celsitudinem tuam deprecor ac potius nunc tibi supp<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>lico, ut, si non tota Biblia ad hunc modum aedenda censueris, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>saltem in libros Sapientales aut Psalterium seu Ecclesiasten <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Salomonis specimen aut gustum aliquem huius futurę aliquando editionis <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>integrę nunc praebeas.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Multorum ingenia sic acuentur <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>linguarum cognitioni penitius incumbendi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>M. <persName>Gallum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>summę eruditionis virum, <placeName ref="l922">Friburgi</placeName> olim agentem (in ędibus enim <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>sapientię, ut vocant, stipendio summo ibidem me continui) saepe hoc <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>optantem audivi, ut prodiret aliquando multarum translationum <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Biblia.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Rogo igitur sublimem eruditionem tuam, ut amore dei <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>provehendęque lucis evangelicę ergo, studio <placeName ref="l862">Helvetię</placeName> nostrae <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>illustrandę, bono reipublicę literarie augmentando et quid non <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>quęrendo pertrahi huc te aliquando patiaris, ut hęc sic fieri <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>aliquando cures.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vive ac vale, decus summum <placeName ref="l862">Helvetię</placeName> nostrę, <lb xml:id="p2z20"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l208">Hedelfingę</placeName> altera septembris anno etc. 57.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Parce epistolę raptim scriptę adeo, ut non vacaret relegere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/><persName ref="p8512">Petrus Venetscherus</persName> <persName>Wallisianus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>minister verbi <placeName ref="l208">Hedelfingę</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Clarissimo omnium doctorum apud <lb xml:id="p3z2"/><placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName> viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>Bullingero</persName> <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>domino suo colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>